    <panel_attributes>title=SD07 Submit answers before derived progress
fontsize=14
obj=GUI or CLI~u
obj=AgentFacade~f
obj=QuizService~s
obj=QuizGrader~g
obj=QuizRepository~r
obj=ProgressTracker~t

u-&gt;f : startAttempt(courseId, quizId)
f-&gt;s : startAttempt(courseId, quizId)
s-&gt;r : saveAttempt(new attempt)
r.&gt;s : saved attempt
s.&gt;f : attempt
f.&gt;u : attempt ID
u-&gt;f : submitAttempt(courseId, attemptId, answers)
f-&gt;s : submitAttempt(courseId, attemptId, answers)
s:Validate IDs and objective formats before first submission
s-&gt;g : grade(quiz, attempt) only on first submission
g.&gt;s : objective and rubric results, including PENDING
s-&gt;r : saveAttempt(submitted answers and results)
r.&gt;s : saved or strict primary error
s-&gt;t : recordQuizAttempt(attempt)
t.&gt;s : in-memory counts and possible cache warning
s-&gt;r : saveAttempt(counted flags)
s:Flag-save failure warns, because answers were already saved
s.&gt;f : saved attempt, score and pending count
f.&gt;u : attempt result (storage warnings available separately)
s:Repeated submissions preserve answers and grades, saved result IDs prevent double counting</panel_attributes>
